07:42.540 --> 07:46.120
Now, from all the testing that we've had our researchers at the company working on,

07:46.120 --> 07:52.600
we found that using a pre-existing sound effects pack like Ocular Sound, which we're not affiliated with in any way,

07:52.860 --> 07:59.200
we just genuinely recommend them so much because they have the highest quality of sound design, I think, of any company publicly available.

07:59.520 --> 08:05.400
So we spent around £500 buying all of their sound effects and giving Claude access to it,

08:05.460 --> 08:08.660
