08:08.860 --> 08:12.540
Now, you could do this with platforms like Artlist, which are much cheaper and have like a subscription,

08:12.540 --> 08:14.940
where you can just go and download a bunch of sound effects.

08:15.160 --> 08:20.820
You know, you can literally search on the Artlist platform like SAS Animation and go and download a bunch of sound effects

08:20.820 --> 08:26.860
and just upload that into your Spotify folder, and it will then build out the sound design for you with all of those sound effects.

08:26.860 --> 08:29.120
So that leads me to tip number six.

08:29.400 --> 08:34.980
Do your visuals first and the sound last, because if you change the animation during any point,

08:35.120 --> 08:37.960
it can mess up your sound design across the project.

08:38.160 --> 08:42.040
So once you're happy with your visuals first that Claude has produced for you,

08:42.040 --> 08:43.680
then go and do your sound design.

